    featuredImagePrompt: "A sleek, modern composition featuring three distinct consumer tech products: a futuristic-looking Fitbit Edge smartwatch with glowing health metrics on its screen, a Withings BodyScan 2 smart scale displaying body composition data, and Nothing Headphone 1 earbuds prominently showcased. The products are arranged on a clean, minimalist surface with a subtle background suggesting a digital marketplace or a tech store, incorporating faint glowing lines to represent connectivity and innovation. The lighting is bright and clean, emphasizing the product details. Shot from a slightly elevated angle, focusing on the products themselves, with a shallow depth of field.",
