    featuredImagePrompt: "A dramatic, conceptual visual representing the tension between advanced AI and societal concerns. Imagine a glowing, intricate AI brain or network structure at the center, surrounded by abstract, shimmering barriers or force fields. On one side, subtle, dark, digital tendrils or glitch effects hint at hacking and security threats. On the other side, shadowy, indistinct human figures or fragmented ethical symbols (like scales of justice, question marks) subtly interact with or recoil from the AI, symbolizing public perception and ethical dilemmas. The overall mood should be thought-provoking and slightly unsettling, using a blend of futuristic blues, purples, and greens with hints of red for risk. Focus on abstract shapes and light, avoiding literal representations of robots or computers. High contrast, digital art style, deep depth of field.",
