    featuredImagePrompt: "An energetic, dynamic shot capturing the essence of the Indian stock market boom. The foreground features a digital stock ticker displaying prominent green upward arrows and positive figures, with 'Sensex' and 'Nifty' clearly visible. In the background, a subtly blurred but recognizable modern skyline of a major Indian financial city (like Mumbai or Delhi) at dawn, symbolizing new beginnings, growth, and economic vibrancy. The overall color palette should be vibrant, dominated by hues of green, gold, and subtle blues, conveying prosperity, optimism, and forward movement. The scene should feel professional, forward-looking, and bustling, reflecting robust economic activity. Focus on a clear, high-resolution industry visual, avoiding any generic stock photo appearance, and without any specific people.",
