    { question: "How does this AI funding impact the global tech market?", answer: "It fuels intense competition for AI talent, drives up valuations for public tech companies with AI exposure, stimulates M&A activity, and accelerates the integration of AI into a wide array of products and services globally." },
    { question: "What are some notable AI startups receiving significant funding?", answer: "Companies like Manifest OS (legaltech), Physical Intelligence (robotics), Halter (agriculture), Cursor (developer tools), Suno (generative music), and Baseten (enterprise AI) are among those securing billions in recent funding rounds." }
