    featuredImagePrompt: "A conceptual visual representing the crypto market surge: abstract golden and purple glowing geometric symbols (subtly hinting at Bitcoin and Ethereum) ascending dynamically through a digital, futuristic landscape. In the background, subtly integrated elements include stylized, flowing data streams, a faint outline of a neural network representing AI, and ethereal, glowing lines suggesting evolving regulatory frameworks. The composition should convey optimism, innovation, and the convergence of finance, technology, and policy, with a sense of upward momentum and clarity. Avoid literal coins or overly busy details. Use a sophisticated color palette with blues, purples, and golds.",
