    featuredImagePrompt: "Conceptual visual: A vibrant, futuristic lab setting where translucent, glowing neural networks (representing AI) are intricately interwoven with abstract biological elements like DNA strands, cellular structures, and stylized human figures. The AI network is visibly accelerating or illuminating these biological processes. Emphasize light, movement, and a sense of scientific breakthrough. Use a palette of blues, greens, and purples with bright white accents. The composition should be dynamic, showing AI as the driving force behind biological innovation. Avoid explicit human faces or overly sterile medical imagery. Focus on the idea of intelligence enhancing life.",
