      probabilityWeightedOutlook: "A probability-weighted outlook suggests a \'Neutral to Cautiously Bullish\' trajectory. While regulatory and security headwinds are significant (40% probability of hindrance), the industry\'s capacity for innovation and self-correction, alongside increasing institutional interest, provides strong underlying support (60% probability of continued growth). The net effect will likely be a more regulated, secure, and ultimately more credible, albeit slower-growing, ecosystem.",
