      keyRisks: ["New restrictive regulations on fast fashion or cross-border e-commerce in key markets.", "Major reputational crisis due to uncovered labor or environmental violations.", "Intensified price wars or market share erosion from aggressive competitors.", "Significant increase in raw material or shipping costs impacting profitability.", "Geopolitical tensions leading to trade barriers or sanctions impacting its supply chain."],
